<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  body { font-family: "Liberation Serif", "DejaVu Serif", Georgia, serif; }
  h1, h2 { font-weight: bold; }
  .header-info { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 40px; }
  .logo-area { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .form-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .form-row > div { width: 50%; }
  .full-width-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .signature-area { margin-top: 60px; }
  .footer-text { font-size: 0.8em; text-align: center; margin-top: 50px; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-info">
    <div class="logo-area">
      <h1 style="font-size: 24px; margin: 0;">New Paltz</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 12px; margin: 2px 0 0 0;">STATE UNIVERSITY OF NEW YORK</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10px; margin: 2px 0 0 0;">Office of Records & Registration, SUNY New Paltz, <span data-field="address.street">{{ address.street }}</span>, <span data-field="address.city">{{ address.city }}</span>, <span data-field="address.state">{{ address.state }}</span> <span data-field="address.zip">{{ address.zip }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; text-align: right;">TEACHER CERTIFICATION AUTHORIZATION</h2>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p style="margin-bottom: 30px;">By completing and signing this form I am authorizing SUNY New Paltz to submit recommendations for Teacher Certification to the New York State Education Department's Office of Teaching Initiatives. I understand I must successfully complete a New York State approved program at the State University of New York at New Paltz and all appropriate New York State certification mandates leading to graduation and certification. I have completed one of SUNY New Paltz's New York State Approved Teacher Education Programs.</p>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div>
      <label for="last_name" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Last Name</label>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 100%;">
        <span data-field="full_name_last">{{ full_name_last }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <label for="first_name" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">First</label>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 100%;">
        <span data-field="full_name_first">{{ full_name_first }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div>
      <label for="permanent_address" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Permanent Address</label>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 100%;">
        <span data-field="address.street_line1">{{ address.street_line1 }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <label for="apt_no" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Apt. No.</label>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 100%;">
        <span data-field="address.apartment">{{ address.apartment }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div>
      <label for="city" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">City</label>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 100%;">
        <span data-field="address.city_line1">{{ address.city_line1 }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <label for="state" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">State</label>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 100%;">
        <span data-field="address.state_line1">{{ address.state_line1 }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="full-width-row">
    <div>
      <label for="zip_code" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Zip Code</label>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 30%;">
        <span data-field="address.zip_line1">{{ address.zip_line1 }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <label for="phone_number" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Telephone Number</label>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 70%;">
        <span data-field="contact.phone_number">{{ contact.phone_number }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 20px;">Program and Degree for Certificate Requested</h3>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div>
      <label for="program" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Program</label>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 50%;">
        <span data-field="program_name">{{ program_name }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <label for="concentration" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Concentration</label>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 50%;">
        <span data-field="concentration_name">{{ concentration_name }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div>
      <label for="degree" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Degree</label>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 50%;">
        <span data-field="degree_name">{{ degree_name }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p style="margin-top: 40px;">I hereby authorize the release of my Name, Social Security Number, Date of Birth, and appropriate Program Code, Award Code, Certification Title, necessary for recommending me for certification to the New York State Education Department's Office of Teaching Initiatives through the TEACH System. I understand the TEACH system is managed and maintained by the New York State Education Department and SUNY New Paltz has no control over its operation.</p>

  <div class="signature-area">
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 50%;">
        <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Print Name (will act as signature)</label>
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 100%;">
          <span data-field="full_name_signature">{{ full_name_signature }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 50%;">
        <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">SUNY New Paltz ID#</label>
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 100%;">
          <span data-field="suny_id">{{ suny_id }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-text">
    <p>PLEASE ALLOW AT LEAST 60 DAYS AFTER THE DEGREE DATE FOR RECORDS TO BE FINALIZED AND THE RECOMMENDATION TO BE SENT TO NYSED.</p>
    <p>Please refer to the following link for further information www.newpaltz.edu/schoolofed/certification.html</p>
    <p style="margin-top: 20px;">4/19</p>
  </div>
</div>